{"id":"pedazo","lemma":"pedazo","pos":"noun","rank":1338,"glosses":["piece, chunk, hunk, bit, bite (a part of a larger whole)","patch (e.g. of sky, cloth, skin, space)","scrap (e.g. of paper, information)"],"ipa":"/peˈdaθo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"pedazos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/34/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-pedazo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Aquí hay un pedazo de papel.","en":"Here's a piece of paper.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/462185","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"paper"}]},{"text":"Ella hizo pedazos su carta.","en":"She tore his letter to pieces.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"letter"}]},{"text":"La botella se hizo pedazos.","en":"The bottle smashed to pieces.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594320","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"bottle"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null]},{"text":"Ella rompió la carta en mil pedazos.","en":"She tore the letter into a thousand pieces.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693478","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to break","l":"romper"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"letter"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"thousand"},null]},{"text":"Dame un pedazo de papel.","en":"Give me a piece of paper.","words":[{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"paper"}]}]}